#org @gText_DoYouWantHardcoreMode
[GREEN]Hardcore Mode[BLACK] makes this game even\nmore difficult as is.\pIt restricts certain abilities and\nmoves from the player, and bosses\lare even more powerful.\pThis game mode is automatically\npaired with [GREEN]Minimal Grinding Mode[BLACK]\lto make it less tedious.\pIt isn't advised to attempt this on\nyour first playthrough.\pDo you want to turn [GREEN]Hardcore\nMode[BLACK] on?

#org @gText_DoYouWantRestrictMode
[GREEN]Restricted Mode[BLACK] restricts certain abi-\nlities and moves from the player.\pDo you want to turn [GREEN]Restricted\nMode[BLACK] on?

#org @gText_DoYouWantRestrictModeOFF
[GREEN]Restricted Mode[BLACK] restricts certain abi-\nlities and moves from the player.\pDo you want to turn [GREEN]Restricted\nMode[BLACK] off?

#org @gText_DoYouWantHardcoreModeOFF
[GREEN]Hardcore Mode[BLACK] makes this game even\nmore difficult as is.\pIt restricts certain abilities and\nmoves from the player, and bosses\lare even more powerful.\pThis game mode is automatically\npaired with [GREEN]Minimal Grinding Mode[BLACK]\lto make it less tedious.\pIt isn't advised to attempt this on\nyour first playthrough.\pDo you want to turn [GREEN]Hardcore\nMode[BLACK] off?

#org @gText_DoYouWantMinGrinding
[GREEN]Minimal Grinding Mode[BLACK] guarantees\nall Pok\emon to have perfect IVs,\land EVs cannot be obtained.\pLikewise, boss Pok\emon will not have\nEVs either.\pThis is for people who dislike\nEV training or grinding for perfect\lIVs.\pDo you want to turn [GREEN]Minimal Grinding\nMode[BLACK] on?

#org @gText_DoYouWantMinGrindingOff
[GREEN]Minimal Grinding Mode[BLACK] guarantees\nall Pok\emon to have perfect IVs,\land EVs cannot be obtained.\pLikewise, boss Pok\emon will not have\nEVs either.\pThis is for people who dislike\nEV training or grinding for perfect\lIVs.\pDo you want to turn [GREEN]Minimal Grinding\nMode[BLACK] off?

#org @gText_MinGrindingInfo
[GREEN]Minimal Grinding Mode[BLACK] guarantees\nall Pok\emon to have perfect IVs,\land EVs cannot be obtained.\pLikewise, boss Pok\emon will not have\nEVs either.\pThis is for people who dislike\nEV training or grinding for perfect\lIVs.\p[GREEN]Hardcore Mode[BLACK] is automatically\nplayed with [GREEN]Minimal Grinding Mode.[BLACK]

#org @gText_DoYouWantEasyMode
[GREEN]Easy Mode[BLACK] removes EVs on boss\nPok\emon, and reduces their levels\lslightly.\pSwitch Mode can also be used, and\nitems are allowed in boss battles.\pThis is a significantly less difficult\nexperience, but still harder than\lvanilla Pok\emon games.\pDo you want to turn on [GREEN]Easy Mode[BLACK]?

#org @gText_DoYouWantEasyModeOFF
[GREEN]Easy Mode[BLACK] removes EVs on boss\nPok\emon, and reduces their levels\lslightly.\pSwitch Mode can also be used, and\nitems are allowed in boss battles.\pThis is a significantly less difficult\nexperience, but still harder than\lvanilla Pok\emon games.\pDo you want to turn off [GREEN]Easy Mode[BLACK]?

